        },
        "bot": "Use this to change a social post that is still a draft, failed, or cancelled. Pass media as a JSON array of media IDs to replace media in order. For Instagram, optional format: feed | short | story. Set scheduledAt to update and schedule in one request; omit it to keep editing without scheduling. The response includes shareUrl for the public preview link.",
